{
  "id": "RAW_58a0cb9b3c",
  "title": "Vercel Sandbox 现已在 Vercel Managed Images 上运行 - Vercel",
  "url": "https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-sandbox-managed-images",
  "date": "2026-08-11 02:00:00",
  "author": "Andy Waller, Tom Lienard, Marc Codina Segura, Luke Phillips-Sheard",
  "siteName": "Vercel News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Today we are introducing Vercel Managed Images (VMI), a set of versioned, open-source base images you can use as-is or extend. The source for every image lives in the public <a href=\"https://github.com/vercel/sandbox\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://github.com/vercel/sandbox\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">vercel/sandbox</a> repository.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Managed images replace Sandbox runtimes, which are now deprecated. Starting with version 3 of the Sandbox SDK, new sandboxes default to <code>vercel/sandbox/universal:latest</code>. It ships with Node.js, Python, common coding agents and standard utilities, so most users never build a custom image or install packages at boot.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">The universal image switches our default operating system from Amazon Linux to Ubuntu, a lighter and more widely used system across the industry.</p>\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#secure-by-default\" id=\"secure-by-default\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Secure by default<!-- --></h3>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Every managed image gets a nightly release. Rolling tags such as <code>latest</code> and the major-version tags pick up operating system and dependency updates automatically, including security patches and new releases of Node.js, Python, and the preinstalled coding agents.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Within each release, dependencies are pinned to specific versions wherever possible, so a given image version stays consistent.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">If you need a fully immutable, reproducible environment, pin to an image digest (SHA). Digest-pinned images opt out of automatic updates.</p>\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#choose-a-managed-image-from-the-catalog\" id=\"choose-a-managed-image-from-the-catalog\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Choose a managed image from the catalog</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Each managed image targets a different starting point:</p>\n    <ul class=\"m-0 flex w-full list-disc flex-col gap-2 p-0 pl-5 [&amp;_li]:pl-2 [&amp;_li]:marker:text-gray-600\">\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color) marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>vercel/sandbox/universal:latest</code> is the new default, a rolling release on Ubuntu 26.04 with Node.js 24, Python 3.14 with <code>uv</code>, the <code>opencode</code>, <code>claude-code</code>, <code>codex</code>, and <code>pi</code> coding agents, and utilities including <code>git</code>, <code>vim</code>, <code>nano</code>, <code>tmux</code>, <code>ripgrep</code>, <code>jq</code>, and <code>fzf</code>.</p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color) marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>vercel/sandbox/node:22</code>, <!-- --><code>node:24</code>, and <!-- --><code>node:26</code> provide Node.js versions on Ubuntu 26.04.<!-- --></p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color) marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>vercel/sandbox/python:3.14</code> provides Python on Ubuntu 26.04.</p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color) marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>vercel/sandbox/ubuntu:latest</code> provides base Ubuntu 26.04 with no extra tooling.</p>\n     </li>\n     <li class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color) marker:text-gray-900 [&amp;_ol]:mt-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>vercel/sandbox/arch:latest</code> provides Arch Linux, regularly updated, with no Node.js or Python preinstalled. Its large package repository makes it useful for agents that install tools on the fly.</p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3 class=\"pt-10 text-heading-24 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#reference-an-image-and-migrate-from-runtimes\" id=\"reference-an-image-and-migrate-from-runtimes\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Reference an image and migrate from runtimes</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Sandboxes can use an image from any repository in your project, a repository which has been <a href=\"https://vercel.com/changelog/share-vercel-container-registry-repositories-across-teams\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/changelog/share-vercel-container-registry-repositories-across-teams\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">shared with your team</a> or <a href=\"https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-container-registry-repositories-can-now-be-made-public\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-container-registry-repositories-can-now-be-made-public\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">any public repository</a>.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Images are addressed by their full path, <code>team-slug/project/repo:tag</code>, for example <code>vercel/sandbox/universal:latest</code>. The SDK types the <code>image</code> property so built-in images autocomplete while any string is still accepted. The previous <code>runtime</code> property is deprecated, not removed, so existing code keeps working.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Amazon Linux runtimes are not part of the managed image catalog, so teams that need AL2023 can stay on <code>runtime</code>. Managed images run as the default <code>ubuntu</code> or <code>arch</code> user with passwordless sudo, rather than the <code>vercel-sandbox</code> user.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-stretch justify-start gap-4 flex-initial blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__wrapper\">\n     <div class=\"my-4 rounded-md group/copy relative overflow-hidden border border-[var(--ds-gray-400)] blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__codeBlock\" data-geist-code-block=\"\">\n      <button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-testid=\"copy/button\" class=\"outline-none m-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] bg-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] font-medium max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,transform,box-shadow] duration-[time:150ms] ease-in-out data-[focus]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-a