:currentColor\">\n           <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.25 2c.14 0 .25.11.25.25V3H10v-.75C10 1.28 9.22.5 8.25.5h-5.5C1.78.5 1 1.28 1 2.25v7.5c0 .97.78 1.75 1.75 1.75H4.5V10H2.75a.25.25 0 0 1-.25-.25v-7.5c0-.14.11-.25.25-.25zm5 4c.14 0 .25.11.25.25v7.5q-.02.23-.25.25h-5.5a.25.25 0 0 1-.25-.25v-7.5c0-.14.11-.25.25-.25zm0 9.5c.97 0 1.75-.78 1.75-1.75v-7.5c0-.97-.78-1.75-1.75-1.75h-5.5C6.78 4.5 6 5.28 6 6.25v7.5c0 .97.78 1.75 1.75 1.75z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n          </svg>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </span></button>\n      <pre class=\"prism-code language-typescript code-block-module__vF3MAa__pre\"><code class=\"font-mono text-left !text-[13px] leading-[20px] break-normal hyphens-none whitespace-pre text-[var(--ds-gray-1000)]\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\" data-geist-code-block=\"true\"><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C23036487-L1\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"> Sandbox </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">'@vercel/sandbox'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C23036487-L2\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C23036487-L3\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span><span class=\"token plain\"> sandbox </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">await</span><span class=\"token plain\"> Sandbox</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">create</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C23036487-L4\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  image</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">'vercel/sandbox/python:3.14'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C23036487-L5\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></div></div></code></pre>\n     </div>\n     <p class=\"text-center text-copy-14 text-gray-900\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Open an issue or a pull request to improve them, and read the <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-sandbox/concepts/images\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-sandbox/concepts/images\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">Vercel Sandbox images documentation</a> to get started.</p>\n   </div>\n   <section class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) flex flex-col gap-4 mt-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-label-14 font-medium\">Contributors</h2>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-900\">\n     <p class=\"text-copy-14 text-pretty\"><a href=\"https://github.com/kevinsundstrom\" rel=\"author\" target=\"_blank\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 hover:underline\">Kevin Sundstrom</a></p>\n    </div>\n   </section>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel 为其 Sandbox 环境推出 Managed Images（ VMI ），用基于 Ubuntu 和 Arch Linux 的版本化、开源基础镜像取代已废弃的运行时。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel 为其 Sandbox 环境推出 Managed Images（ VMI ），用基于 Ubuntu 和 Arch Linux 的版本化、开源基础镜像取代已废弃的运行时。",
  "summary": "Vercel 已推出 Vercel Managed Images（ VMI ），这是一套用于驱动 Vercel Sandbox 的开源基础镜像。此更新将默认操作系统从 Amazon Linux 切换为 Ubuntu，并引入了预装 Node.js、Python 以及多种编码代理（ 如 Claude Code ）的 “ 通用 ” 镜像。系统支持滚动标签以实现自动安全更新，并提供 SHA 锁定以确保环境不可变。开发者现在可以通过 SDK 使用完整路径指定镜像，而之前的 ‘ runtime ’ 属性仍保留以兼容旧版。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "从 Sandbox 运行时迁移到 Managed Images。",
      "explanation": "Vercel 正在废弃 ‘ runtime ’ 属性，改用 ‘ image ’，以通过开源基础镜像实现更好的版本管理和自定义。"
    },
    {
      "point": "推出用于 AI 驱动开发的 “ 通用 ” 镜像。",
      "explanation": "新的默认镜像包含必备运行时（ Node.js 、 Python ）以及流行的编码代理，如 claude-code 和 opencode，降低了自定义启动时安装的需求。"
    },
    {
      "point": "操作系统默认值及灵活性的转变。",
      "explanation": "默认操作系统已切换至 Ubuntu 26.04，以提升行业兼容性；同时提供 Arch Linux 作为需要更大软件仓库的用户的替代方案。"
    }
  ],
